# A piston engine in outline: the crank pin runs on the crank circle, the rod has a set
# length, and the piston (a rectangle) keeps to the cylinder's centre line.
circle crankcircle r 20 at 0,0
fix crankcircle.center
construction line bore from 0,0 to 0,140 fixed
fix bore.end
point pinpt at 14.14,14.14
on pinpt crankcircle
line rod from pinpt to 0,88 length 75
on rod.end bore
rect piston about 30 x 24 centred at 0,100
midpoint rod.end of piston.south
horizontal piston.south
equal piston.west piston.east
dim piston.south = 30
